    "q-326891": {
      "dom_id": "step-q326891",
      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "Find $30%$ of $50,$ and then $20%$ of the result.",
      "worked_solution": "First, we find $30%$ of $50:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}30%\\times 50 & =\\frac{30}{100}\\times 50 \\\\  & =0.3\\times 50 \\\\  & =15\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we find $20%$ of the result $(15):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}20%\\times 15 & =\\frac{20}{100}\\times 15 \\\\  & =0.2\\times 15 \\\\  & =3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the final answer is $3.$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
