    "q-327231": {
      "dom_id": "step-q327231",
      "name": "Question 2",
      "problem": "Find $110%$ of $80,$ and then $30%$ of the result.",
      "worked_solution": "First, we find $110%$ of $80:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}110%\\times 80 & =\\frac{110}{100}\\times 80 \\\\  & =1.1\\times 80 \\\\  & =88\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we find $30%$ of the result $(88):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}30%\\times 88 & =\\frac{30}{100}\\times 88 \\\\  & =0.3\\times 88 \\\\  & =26.4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the final answer is $26.4.$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
